invariant: INV-44
file: p384_wide_point.c
catches: p384_equiv_test
reason: the comparison takes r + n for a second value of x when it is
  p or more, and the field reduces it, so r = p - n passes for the
  point whose x is 0. bin/p384_equiv_test builds that signature and
  wants 0.

